--- 1. an old guard, registered, a list without Fable: refreshed, Fable back once, marker
rc 0
guard: the kit's own bytes
availableModels: ["opus", "sonnet", "haiku", "fable"]
marker: written
guard: executable
--- 2. the same machine, updated again: nothing changes
rc 0
settings.json: byte-identical
guard: byte-identical
availableModels: ["opus", "sonnet", "haiku", "fable"]
--- 3. a machine the guard never reached (no file, no hook): nothing is created
rc 0
guard: none on disk
availableModels: ["opus", "sonnet", "haiku"]
marker: none
on disk: settings.json 
--- 4. a guard on disk but not registered: the script is refreshed, the list is untouched
rc 0
guard: the kit's own bytes
availableModels: ["opus", "sonnet", "haiku"]
marker: none
--- 5. no POLARIS_SHA (a zip or skill install): nothing happens
rc 0
guard: NOT the kit copy
availableModels: ["opus", "sonnet", "haiku"]
marker: none
--- 6. the job runner agent rides the .claude/ step (walk-away § 3.2): ours replaced, theirs kept
rc 0
agent: the kit's own bytes
