  maxTurns: 12
  omitClaudeMd: true
  heading lines: 0
rc 0
agent: replaced on the next install
agent: the human's own file kept
rc 0
agent: a third install changes nothing
agent: no output line names it
--- 7. the update's machine refresh writes nothing to settings.json, agent or human (shared-kit § 11)
CLAUDECODE=1: settings.json byte-identical
CLAUDECODE=<empty>: settings.json byte-identical
keep-awake script: refreshed to the kit's bytes
--- the install output gains no line
guard refreshed vs nothing armed: same line count
no updater vs updater: same line count
no output line names the guard or the list
